<title>ALGERIA: Official results of Algeria's general election..</title>
<headline>Official results of Algeria's general election..</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the final official results of Algeria's general election as released by Interior Minister Mustapha Benmansour on Friday.</p>
<p>			  Statistics:</p>
<p>Number of eligible voters: 16,773,087 Number of voters:	    10,983,985</p>
<p>Turnout:			 65.49 percent</p>
<p>Invalid ballots:		  493,676</p>
<p>Valid ballots:		 10,490,309</p>
<p>	    --------------------------------------</p>
<p>			    Results:</p>
<p>Party				 Number of votes	 Seats</p>
<p>--------			    -----------------     -------</p>
<p>1-National Democratic Rally     3,533,762		 155</p>
<p>2-Movement of Peaceful Society  1,553,185		  69</p>
<p>3-National Liberation Front     1,489,561		  64</p>
<p>4-Nahda Movement			915,066		  34</p>
<p>5-Socialist Forces Front	    465,957		  19</p>
<p>6-Rally for Democracy and Culture 444,586		  19</p>
<p>7-Independents			  475,746		  11</p>
<p>8-Workers Party			 197,251		   4</p>
<p>9-Progressive Republican Party     65,441		   3</p>
<p>10-Union for Democracy and Liberty 49,308		   1</p>
<p>11-Social Liberal Party		36,521		   1</p>
</text>
